{"version":1,"key":"article:70","content":{"id":70,"title":"面试题：缓存异步函数","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"039952ae-14fd-44f1-9620-4d37b81c9c2e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记一次面试题，当时写了很久都没有实现，特此记录。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"785516ce-a6d5-410e-a73c-75f4fdfc7236","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目介绍"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0dab8904-932e-47b5-aea8-a3585c0a8b8d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实现一个函数可以对异步函数的结果进行缓存"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"ca0d81b5-cb7f-4d9b-b36b-07b770824484","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"43963848-8780-4cd8-bb91-2690d88406ad","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const cacheAsyncFunc = (asyncFunc) => {\n  // TODO\n}\n\nconst asyncAdd = (num1, num2) => {\n  console.log(`perform asyncAdd ${num1} ${num2}`)\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      resolve(num1 + num2)\n    }, 1000)\n  })\n}\n\nconst cacheAdd = cacheAsyncFunc(asyncAdd);\n\ncacheAdd(1, 2).then(res => console.log(res))\ncacheAdd(2, 3).then(res => console.log(res))\ncacheAdd(1, 2).then(res => console.log(res))","collabId":"4154fb9c-c56d-4cd3-ad76-27a0c5ce4a20","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f4a6b536-ce90-4739-80b5-19cbe0f77ae4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实现 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cacheAsyncFunc"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 使其输出为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"f10b758b-db76-4990-b458-1ed7c25fb5bd","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b8572929-7473-41ac-b2fb-184010f09518","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"perform asyncAdd 1 2\nperform asyncAdd 2 3\n3\n5\n3","collabId":"9d6a1a10-0dcd-4c38-97d1-9eeb82a168f7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"4fee03ab-70e1-457e-ab17-ae54ba36986b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"初步实现"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9e8c7090-9d46-41e5-a032-c278258c16b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先我实现了一个显而易见的版本"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"05f35508-2822-4ddf-b050-cfdedba5802a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ccb24b36-78e6-4a9a-b36a-4689be202d62","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const cacheAsyncFunc = (asyncFunc) => {\n  const cache = new Map();\n\n  return (...args) => {\n    const key = JSON.stringify(args);\n\n    if (cache.has(key)) {\n      return cache.get(key);\n    }\n\n    const result = asyncFunc(...args);\n    cache.set(key, result);\n    return result;\n  };\n};","collabId":"7586098a-bd45-4f36-890e-635d900d6644","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0cf5ccd6-55e6-4e18-851d-92e50d30fd9f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是其实际结果是"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JS","uuid":"be0995c1-5d9c-4fec-8ab3-1d2b8d534e69","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1d44a998-0a44-47dd-8aa8-4e3baa53d432","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"perform asyncAdd 1 2\nperform asyncAdd 2 3\n3\n3\n5","collabId":"9b0b74b8-e018-42e1-a250-9cd4fe6071a8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c00c0457-b446-4cd4-954f-eec5436db47f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以看到输出的结果是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"3 3 5"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，而不是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"3 5 3"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我就是卡在这里百思不得其解。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"43e3743b-04c8-40be-8470-acc1aec7aef3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"原因分析"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b7a990f8-c7ef-465b-9fbf-3517a4379423","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"先解释原因，要从宏任务和微任务的角度考虑："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"f7f29648-20c1-466f-969c-22b7e615598f","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"63a2647d-1acc-4773-b682-a6418c2ae55b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0da2a3ad-d7f4-4f4d-b240-bb7aff962e75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一次执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cacheAdd(1, 2)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时无缓存，会执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"asyncAdd(1, 2)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，此时会执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setTimeout"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，返回一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，记为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"p1"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d37f7b8b-f28b-4e7d-8594-5a2fdf72b1ab","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e962ffb4-7a37-4dc5-84ff-38955cb86e7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第二次执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cacheAdd(2, 3)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也无缓存，会执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"asyncAdd(2, 3)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，此时又会执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setTimeout"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，返回一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，记为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"p2"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0a528ca5-de5a-4947-ae5b-4ae1cd8927eb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ce6e6f19-2999-483c-8950-87ece57acb10","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第三次执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cacheAdd(1, 2)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，存在缓存，将之前缓存的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"p1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"32169076-c6ec-4b59-ad9c-df0394dbf820","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1s"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 后定时器结束，宏任务队列会存在两个待执行的任务，第一个任务会执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"resolve(3)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"p1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 变为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fullfilled"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"then"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的两个回调函数扔进微任务队列，宏任务执行完成，开始执行微任务队列中所有的微任务，所以会先打印两次 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"3"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，接着执行第二个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setTimeout"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 注册的宏任务，执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"resolve(5)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"p2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 变为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fullfiled"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，把 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"p2.then"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 注册的回调函数扔进微任务队列，宏任务执行完成，执行微任务，打印 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"5"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"e084aa7f-dcb9-4824-8b60-f8772da3b253","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决方案"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d725a113-a2f8-46b9-9c16-504ccb3f53d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在分析出原因后，我以为需要从宏任务和微任务的角度去解决这个问题，所以我给出了下面的解法"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"danger","title":"最开始的思路","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"4918493a-7796-4618-b7a8-ba88963636b9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1dd1613e-979f-4616-b421-94ac36788e48","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了保证执行顺序，就不能直接返回缓存的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 了，而应该返回一个新的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这个新的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 应该在下一个宏任务中才变为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fullfilled"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这样就可以保证执行顺序"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"782b61e7-b078-45ed-aea6-eff304c94f26","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4d583773-ed97-437d-bc35-b2af00569242","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const executeInNextFrame = (callback) => {\n  const channel = new MessageChannel();\n  const { port1, port2 } = channel;\n  port2.onmessage = callback;\n  port1.postMessage(null);\n}\n\nconst cacheAsyncFunc = (asyncFunc) => {\n  const cache = new Map();\n\n  return (...args) => {\n    const key = JSON.stringify(args);\n\n    if (cache.has(key)) {\n      return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n        cache.get(key).then((value) => {\n          executeInNextFrame(() => {\n            resolve(value);\n          })\n        }, reject);\n      })\n    }\n\n    const result = asyncFunc(...args);\n    cache.set(key, result);\n    return result;\n  };\n};\n\nconst asyncAdd = (num1, num2) => {\n  console.log(`perform asyncAdd ${num1} ${num2}`);\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      resolve(num1 + num2);\n    }, 1000);\n  });\n};","collabId":"3241ad16-a7bb-4b6e-8f92-34dee389c720","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bf9cd4cc-3daf-4a58-ab7a-0a5a9b0d967a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实现上述能力后，我还有点沾沾自喜，竟能想到如此精妙绝伦的解法，把题目给各种 AI 后，发现 AI 给出的解法和我一开始的解法一样，也不过如此，此时我已经有点飘了，却不知我在愚昧之巅，后来 DeepSeek R1 出来，让 DeepSeek R1 试了下，我才知道我是小丑，现在回想，真是太蠢了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"002543d2-f679-4b45-b0c8-c67419165c47","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面基于宏任务的解法根本无法保证顺序性，在加一个例子就可以看到"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"13064976-4829-42ac-bb5c-b2b6abb71974","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f0ac9b76-e704-457e-b487-b2f276d234dc","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"cacheAdd(1, 2).then(res => console.log(res))\ncacheAdd(2, 3).then(res => console.log(res))\ncacheAdd(1, 2).then(res => console.log(res))\ncacheAdd(3, 3).then(res => console.log(res))","collabId":"f89175f4-a6d5-4628-8a30-8c6dce254664","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"","uuid":"128ddb7a-902f-4ada-bc15-063e4d9b2f11","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f152aafa-9f90-42e5-b0f5-dcfdd16f894f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"perform asyncAdd 1 2\nperform asyncAdd 2 3\nperform asyncAdd 3 3\n3\n5\n6\n3","collabId":"b64125d4-6a21-4585-a373-1036845c88cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a1f1c5a1-634e-46ad-9742-4e1f86528952","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为第二个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cacheAdd(1, 2)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是在下一个宏任务队列中，而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cacheAdd(3, 3)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 则是在微任务队列中，所以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cacheAdd(3, 3)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的结果先于第二个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cacheAdd(1, 2)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 完成，输出顺序不对。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e6dfc768-c21a-4c73-9dcf-c1781cfff6b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最朴素的想法，要保证执行顺序，就得使用"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"队列"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，把结果都放入到队列中，必须等上一个结果完成后（无论是成功还是失败），才能将后面的结果置位、问完成，思路非常简单"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"b9de9911-c082-4df3-b4b5-cefe745e271d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8b0923a0-7b13-4a1e-bab7-c53b3fcee28f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const cacheAsyncFunc = (asyncFunc) => {\n  const cache = new Map();\n  const resQueue = [];\n  let isChecking = false;\n\n  const check = () => {\n    if (resQueue.length === 0) {\n      isChecking = false;\n      return;\n    }\n    const { result, resolve, reject } = resQueue.shift();\n    result.then(resolve, reject).finally(check);\n  }\n\n  return (...args) => {\n    const key = JSON.stringify(args);\n\n    let result;\n    if (cache.has(key)) {\n      result = cache.get(key);\n    } else {\n      result = asyncFunc(...args);\n      cache.set(key, result);\n    }\n\n    const { promise, resolve, reject } = Promise.withResolvers();\n    resQueue.push({\n      result,\n      resolve,\n      reject,\n    });\n\n    if (!isChecking) {\n      isChecking = true;\n      check();\n    }\n\n    return promise;\n  };\n};","collabId":"e020d108-298d-494d-a477-d77400ee05e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/sean-pierce-d4BXj4TE3vE-unsplash_7e981482-da25-4bf1-8b8b-092e670e3688.jpg","createTime":1734359074210,"updateTime":1775957607478},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1775957607478}}